# Pairs with BornImpliesIntent. A sibling is persisted with no split in flight,
# an orphan leaf from the start.
MODULE: BornImpliesIntentBirthWithoutSplit
TARGET: BornImpliesIntent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a sibling is born although no split is in flight
PERTURBS: Birth

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "intent" /\ ~born
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no split intent required.
    /\ ~born
--- END
